d-100 text-emerald-800 text-[10px] font-bold px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full whitespace-nowrap\"> 4.20</span>\n          </div>\n          <p class=\"text-[11px] text-stone-500\"> 地下鉄空港線「唐人町駅」より徒歩2分。PayPayドーム徒歩圏内。</p>\n          <p class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 bg-stone-50 p-2.5 rounded-xl border border-stone-100 leading-relaxed font-medium\"> 破格の2,000円台！駅近で荷物を預けて身軽にドームへ。博多もつ鍋や屋台巡りの資金をたっぷり残せます。</p>\n          <div class=\"pt-1\">\n            <span class=\"text-[10px] text-stone-400 block\">最安参考料金（1名）</span>\n            <span class=\"text-lg font-black text-emerald-700\">¥2,472〜</span>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"p-4 pt-0\">\n          <a href=\"https://hb.afl.rakuten.co.jp/hgc/54d2a438.4bc4abc2.54d2a439.aa1be583/?pc=https%3A%2F%2Ftravel.rakuten.co.jp%2FHOTEL%2F199460%2F199460.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"sponsored noopener noreferrer\" class=\"block w-full text-center text-xs font-bold text-white bg-emerald-700 hover:bg-emerald-800 py-2.5 rounded-xl transition\">\n            楽天トラベルで空室・プランを見る →\n          </a>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- ご褒美贅沢派 -->\n  <div class=\"my-6\">\n    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\">\n      <span class=\"text-base\"></span>\n      <h4 class=\"font-bold text-rose-900 text-base\">余韻と観光を味わう！ご褒美＆ドーム直結ホテル</h4>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4\">\n\n      <div class=\"bg-white rounded-2xl border border-rose-200 overflow-hidden shadow-sm flex flex-col justify-between\">\n        <div class=\"p-4 space-y-2\">\n          <div class=\"flex justify-between items-start gap-2\">\n            <h5 class=\"font-bold text-stone-900 text-sm\">ヒルトン福岡シーホーク</h5>\n            <span class=\"bg-rose-100 text-rose-800 text-[10px] font-bold px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full whitespace-nowrap\"> 4.31</span>\n          </div>\n          <p class=\"text-[11px] text-stone-500\"> PayPayドーム直結！ドーム隣接のフラッグシップリゾートホテル。</p>\n          <p class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 bg-rose-50/50 p-2.5 rounded-xl border border-rose-100 leading-relaxed font-medium\"> 全室博多湾オーシャンビュー！ドーム直結のため終演後3分でベッドへ。バルコニーやラウンジで味わう余韻は極上。</p>\n          <div class=\"pt-1\">\n            <span class=\"text-[10px] text-stone-400 block\">最安参考料金（1名）</span>\n            <span class=\"text-lg font-black text-rose-600\">¥12,683〜</span>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"p-4 pt-0\">\n          <a href=\"https://hb.afl.rakuten.co.jp/hgc/54d2a438.4bc4abc2.54d2a439.aa1be583/?pc=https%3A%2F%2Ftravel.rakuten.co.jp%2FHOTEL%2F3233%2F3233.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"sponsored noopener noreferrer\" class=\"block w-full text-center text-xs font-bold text-white bg-rose-700 hover:bg-rose-800 py-2.5 rounded-xl transition\">\n            楽天トラベルで空室・プランを見る →\n          </a>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"my-10 p-6 md:p-8 bg-stone-100 rounded-3xl border border-stone-300 shadow-sm space-y-6\">\n  <div class=\"border-b border-stone-300 pb-4\">\n    <span class=\"text-[11px] font-bold text-rose-700 bg-rose-100 px-3 py-1 rounded-full uppercase tracking-wider inline-block mb-1\">\n      EXPEDITION ESSENTIALS\n    </span>\n    <h3 class=\"text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-stone-900\">\n      宿を抑えたら次はこれ！推し活遠征で絶対後悔しない「必須持ち物3選」\n    </h3>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-4 text-xs\">\n    <div class=\"bg-white p-5 rounded-2xl border border-stone-200 shadow-xs space-y-2\">\n      <h4 class=\"font-bold text-stone-900 text-sm\">1. モバイルバッテリー（20,000mAh）</h4>\n      <p class=\"text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">電子チケット、連番相手との連絡、会場位置情報で充電の減りは通常の3倍。大容量タイプを必ず持参。</p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"bg-white p-5 rounded-2xl border border-stone-200 shadow-xs space-y-2\">\n      <h4 class=\"font-bold text-stone-900 text-sm\">2. 硬質うちわケース＆銀テケース</h4>\n      <p class=\"text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">遠征バッグの中でうちわの骨が折れるのを防ぐハードケースと、アリーナで降ってきた銀テープを丸めて保護するケース。</p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"bg-white p-5 rounded-2xl border border-rose-200 shadow-xs space-y-2\">\n      <h4 class=\"font-bold text-rose-900 text-sm\">3. オートフォーカス双眼鏡</h4>\n      <p class=\"text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">ピント調節不要で、動く推しを瞬時にロックオン。マツエク・メガネに完全対応し、暗い演出でも明るく視界を確保。</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"pt-2 text-center\">\n    <a href=\"https://mono-repo.hatenablog.jp/entry/2026/11/02/182514\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-bold text-white bg-rose-600 hover:bg-rose-700 px-8 py-3.5 rounded-full shadow transition\">\n      <span>ライブ特化型オートフォーカス双眼鏡の詳しいレビュー・選び方はこちら（はてなブログ）</span>\n      <span>→</span>\n    </a>\n  </div>\n</section>\n",
